# /old/ — FROZEN ARCHIVE of the previous site design.
#
# Kept so the old build can be read or restored. It is NOT a running site:
#   • It has no assets/data or assets/img of its own (those live at the web
#     root and belong to the current site), so its catalogue renders empty.
#   • PHP is denied below, so its admin, mailer and beacon cannot run. That is
#     deliberate: a half-working admin here would write a SECOND, diverging
#     copy of the product data, and its contact form would post real enquiries
#     from a page nobody maintains.
#
# To restore this design, move these files back to the web root rather than
# trying to make them work in place.

# Keep the archive out of search results entirely.
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header set X-Robots-Tag "noindex, nofollow, noarchive"
</IfModule>

# No server-side code runs in the archive.
<FilesMatch "\.(php|phtml|php[0-9])$">
  Require all denied
</FilesMatch>

# No directory listings.
Options -Indexes
